flowchart TB
  IN["I29: Admin workstation or access migration"]:::source
  CONTROL["Required controls<br/>X11"]:::control
  S1["Inventory Windows and WSL identities<br/>independently<br/><b>OpenSSH / task owner</b>"]:::process
  IN --> S1
  S2["Verify host keys and protected key ACLs<br/><b>Authorized operator</b>"]:::process
  S1 --> S2
  S3["Record logon tasks, local listeners and<br/>tunnel purpose<br/><b>Task Scheduler / systemd</b>"]:::process
  S2 --> S3
  S4["Prefer server-owned critical scheduling<br/><b>Ansible / systemd</b>"]:::process
  S3 --> S4
  GATE{"Expected listeners and identities<br/>verified?"}:::gate
  S4 --> GATE
  GATE -- "No / unknown" --> HOLD["HOLD<br/>Repair, review or reconcile"]:::hold
  CONTROL -. "enforced at action boundary" .-> GATE
  S5["Validate controlled logon/restart and<br/>fallback path<br/><b>Operator</b>"]:::process
  GATE -- "Yes" --> S5
  OUT["Documented workstation dependencies and<br/>reduced critical coupling"]:::done
  S5 --> OUT
  NEXT["Connected handoffs<br/>I30, I35, L04"]:::ext
  OUT --> NEXT

